  "url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/product/drip-brutalyn/",
  "description": "Unleash raw street art energy, urban graffiti style, and bold dripping attitude with DRIP BRUTALYN, a dynamic graffiti font! Masterfully engineered with expressive hand-painted paint drips, energetic spray-can brush strokes, and crisp black-and-white outline contrast set against vibrant splatter backdrops, DRIP BRUTALYN transforms typography into authentic street statements. Complete with extra swashes and graffiti ornaments like crowns and arrows, it stands as an essential selection for streetwear apparel branding, hip-hop album covers, skateboarding graphics, action sports posters, graffiti murals, and high-impact street logotypes.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Unleash raw street art energy, urban graffiti style, and bold dripping attitude with DRIP BRUTALYN, a dynamic graffiti font! Masterfully engineered with expressive hand-painted paint drips, energetic spray-can brush strokes, and crisp black-and-white outline contrast set against vibrant splatter backdrops, DRIP BRUTALYN transforms typography into authentic street statements. Complete with extra swashes and graffiti ornaments like crowns and arrows, it stands as an essential selection for streetwear apparel branding, hip-hop album covers, skateboarding graphics, action sports posters, graffiti murals, and high-impact street logotypes.</p>",
